{
  "file_id": "3620",
  "text_count": 57,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������So? Do you feel Gankuumon's\npresence here?",
      "_offset": 2765,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Nope. Not from here, anyway.",
      "_offset": 2816,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Hm... By the way, Hackmon, are you\ndoing okay?",
      "_offset": 2845,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Looks like it's gonna be a bit\nlonger.",
      "_offset": 2896,
      "_length": 38,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Uh-oh!",
      "_offset": 2938,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "We're surrounded!",
      "_offset": 2945,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "We've got Hackmon with us, and\nhe's wounded. How are we gonna\nescape with him?",
      "_offset": 2963,
      "_length": 78,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "What are we gonna do...",
      "_offset": 3042,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Take that!",
      "_offset": 3066,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Hey! Are you guys okay?",
      "_offset": 3077,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Who are you?",
      "_offset": 3101,
      "_length": 12,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "I'm Taiki Kudou!",
      "_offset": 3114,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "And I'm Shoutmon, the Digimon\nKing!",
      "_offset": 3131,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "The Digimon King?",
      "_offset": 3167,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 7,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Well, first, let's try to get out\nof here! Ready, Shoutmon?",
      "_offset": 3185,
      "_length": 59,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Hah! Take that!",
      "_offset": 3245,
      "_length": 15,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "All right, now's our chance!",
      "_offset": 3261,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "Y-Yeah!",
      "_offset": 3290,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "So that's what happened...",
      "_offset": 3298,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "Gankuumon was the one who brought\nus here, huh...",
      "_offset": 3325,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Seems like Hackmon knows who that\nGankuumon guy is.",
      "_offset": 3375,
      "_length": 51,
      "speaker_id": 8,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "He's probably got some kind of\nplan.",
      "_offset": 3431,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 18,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Ever since we were brought here,\nI've been trying to gather\ninformation...",
      "_offset": 3468,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "But thanks to you guys, I think I\nhave a good grasp of the\nsituation.",
      "_offset": 3543,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "Well, by running into us by\naccident, anyway.",
      "_offset": 3613,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Why don't you guys help us out?\nWe'll look for a way out together!",
      "_offset": 3659,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Sure! Sounds good!",
      "_offset": 3726,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "You've just established an\nalliance with Team Xros Heart!",
      "_offset": 3745,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Xros... Heart?",
      "_offset": 3803,
      "_length": 14,
      "speaker_id": 3,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "Yeah, it's the team name for all\nof our friends.",
      "_offset": 3818,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "Taiki's our General! He's the one\nwho leads me and my friends into\nbattle!",
      "_offset": 3867,
      "_length": 74,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Wow...",
      "_offset": 3942,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "Seems like your Digimon really\nlikes you.",
      "_offset": 3949,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Taiki's the kind of person who\ncan't leave someone behind when\nthey're in trouble!",
      "_offset": 3991,
      "_length": 82,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Well... you get angry with me\nsometimes, though.",
      "_offset": 4074,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "You dare to make a copy of *me*?",
      "_offset": 4130,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Don't let your guard down,\nShoutmon!",
      "_offset": 4163,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Right!",
      "_offset": 4200,
      "_length": 6,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Let's go, Agumon!",
      "_offset": 4207,
      "_length": 17,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "Okay, Tai!",
      "_offset": 4225,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 6,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Didja see that? That's the power\nof the *real* Digimon King!",
      "_offset": 4239,
      "_length": 60,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "We did it!",
      "_offset": 4300,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "You did great too, Agumon.",
      "_offset": 4311,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Heh heh!",
      "_offset": 4338,
      "_length": 8,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Well, I guess we're splitting up\nhere. Thanks for all the help!",
      "_offset": 4347,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Likewise!",
      "_offset": 4411,
      "_length": 9,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "I'm worried about Hackmon. He\nstill can't even talk...",
      "_offset": 4421,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "It's okay! Leave him to us!",
      "_offset": 4476,
      "_length": 27,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "All right, take care of him!",
      "_offset": 4504,
      "_length": 28,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "All right, see you!",
      "_offset": 4533,
      "_length": 19,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Oh yeah, by the way... there's\nsomeone else who came with us.",
      "_offset": 4553,
      "_length": 61,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "I wonder where he ran off to...",
      "_offset": 4615,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "If you run into him, take care of\nhim for me, okay? He'll help you\nout, too.",
      "_offset": 4647,
      "_length": 76,
      "speaker_id": 21,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "All right, I'll remember that!",
      "_offset": 4724,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 2,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "【Area 1】",
      "_offset": 4755,
      "_length": 22,
      "speaker_id": 255,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "【Area 2】",
      "_offset": 4778,
